[{"client_msg_id":"806929c1-4e2e-4937-93dc-663bf3ededf1","type":"message","user":"U014M3YCYAD","text":"cocからvim-lspに引越し中なんですが、Vue3対応language serverのvolarがあるけど入れてみても変換候補が出てこない。。\nコードアクションは動くから全くダメじゃないけど何だろう...","ts":"1632986090.018700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZEsHW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7627c05-fb44-41f2-b599-908f0c81ac56","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"VSCode でも有効にするとマシンに負荷がかかるみたいですね。なのでデフォ false で且つ、experimental なのかも。","ts":"1632981459.015600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vEA3O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"efd1a0e0-2df1-4217-992e-c1bd1d7a8c3f","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"意外に、思ったより書く量は少なそうでしたが。なんか CPU 100% になるとか、マシンに負荷かかるとかそんな issue かもです。","ts":"1632981353.014700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9oz0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8fe470e-af79-4a8e-a89a-edd338c1a867","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"丁度grepしてました、そういう経緯もあるなら一旦諦めかなー","ts":"1632980796.012700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w3/U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed0abad9-30fb-4d98-a246-7ea625cf6303","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"雑に `enableProjectDiagnostics` で grep すると良いかもですね。ただ、 coc-tsserver では追加されない気がします。過去 issue になんかやらないようなものが見つかったかもです。あとは experimental のようですしね","ts":"1632980545.012200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rHB=s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85ed174f-dfdc-46ab-92b5-e7108a485163","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"お、ありがとうございます","ts":"1632980471.012000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1=D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"525ef582-749a-457b-b13e-7c7d9aaccd16","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"coc-tsserver で機能追加する場合は VSCode 本体の `typescript-language-features` の中身をがんばってポートしてくって感じになると思います。 \u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/vscode/tree/main/extensions/typescript-language-features\u003e","ts":"1632980387.011800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Enru"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94a0dad5-2144-4a15-86eb-29f614d0b0cb","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"パラメーターは true, false だけじゃないですかね。","ts":"1632980309.011600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iBj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa9823ab-0c78-463a-b57b-2ed71649fd12","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Enable Project Diagnosticsはcoc-tsserverレベルで設定可能にしたいなぁ\nVSCodeが渡してるパラメータのトレースとかが多分必要なんですよねこれ","ts":"1632978330.010600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CitD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5eac35cb-d248-40cc-beb6-37d1673fd1bb","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"で、そこ設定したらproject localなts-graphql-pluginが動作するようになりました\nよかった","ts":"1632977841.009900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"28hyl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c49d1c1-6c54-4746-8b91-1670fcbee3f0","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"はい。了解ｄす","ts":"1632977703.009300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xyZXg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a52c2eee-5a39-4d6e-8d02-709f86ad6e49","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、そこでした\nすみません・・・","ts":"1632977699.009100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zJT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9aed4d9f-29eb-4510-96ba-4b58db2bf992","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"4.4.3 のバージョンのところを押して Select TypeScript Version... ってのを選ぶと、進めると思います。そうすると .vscode/settings.json に設定が書かれる","ts":"1632977696.008900"